WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.750 line:6% align:center
Three drops of ink let fall by Hwanin
made the continents bloom.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.800 line:6% align:center
The ink shaped villages and woke all living things,
and life flourished across the land.

3
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.900 line:6% align:center
The deepened spirit of the ink rose into the sky
and at last reached Hwanin.

4
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:26.400 line:6% align:center
Hwanin gave them kites
to guide the wind and water,

5
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.650 line:6% align:center
and gave them wisps
to tend the fire.

6
00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:36.350 line:6% align:center
Kite, ink and wisp
lived in harmony with all living things.

7
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:40.550 line:6% align:center
And so begins a story painted in ink.
